01077: #===============================================================================
01078: # DamageCalcFromTarget handlers
01079: # NOTE: Species-specific held items consider the original species, not the
01080: #       transformed species, and still work while transformed. The exceptions
01081: #       are Metal/Quick Powder, which don't work if the holder is transformed.
01082: #===============================================================================
01083: 
01084: Battle::ItemEffects::DamageCalcFromTarget.add(:ASSAULTVEST,
